{"id":"b1e779ca93eb771b","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-monopole.md","title":"Bogomolny Monopole","display":"df-monopole — Bogomolny Monopole","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-monopole","aliases":["58-df-monopole","Bogomolny Monopole"],"display":"df-monopole — Bogomolny Monopole","depends_on":["[[58-df-gauge-theory]]","[[58-df-principal-bundle]]","[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[58-df-hodge-star]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-monopole"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-monopole</span><span>Bogomolny Monopole</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-monopole — Bogomolny Monopole"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46de5f0e3011160d\" href=\"?note=46de5f0e3011160d\" title=\"58-df-gauge-theory\">58-df-gauge-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d5f05282b5c6816\" href=\"?note=5d5f05282b5c6816\" title=\"58-df-principal-bundle\">58-df-principal-bundle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" href=\"?note=c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" title=\"58-df-hodge-star\">58-df-hodge-star</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,g,o)\">\\((M,g,o)\\)</span> is an oriented Riemannian three-manifold, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> is a nowhere-vanishing orientation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span>-form.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p:P\\to M,\\tau_P,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\">\\((p:P\\to M,\\tau_P,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\\)</span> is a smooth principal bundle and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak g\">\\(\\mathfrak g\\)</span> is the Lie algebra of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Omega^1(P;\\mathfrak g)\">\\(A\\in\\Omega^1(P;\\mathfrak g)\\)</span> is a principal connection form and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\Omega^0(M;\\operatorname{ad}P)\">\\(\\phi\\in\\Omega^0(M;\\operatorname{ad}P)\\)</span> is a Higgs field.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_a:P\\to P\">\\(R_a:P\\to P\\)</span> is right translation, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi_P\">\\(\\xi_P\\)</span> is the fundamental vector field of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\in\\mathfrak g\">\\(\\xi\\in\\mathfrak g\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*_g^o\">\\(*_g^o\\)</span> is the Hodge star determined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> and its positive volume form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{vol}_g^o\">\\(\\mathrm{vol}_g^o\\)</span> compatible with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BogomolnyMonopole}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BogomolnyMonopole}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole\\text{-}principal\\text{-}connection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Omega^1(P;\\mathfrak g)\\land\n\\forall a\\in G\\;(R_a^*A=\\operatorname{Ad}_{a^{-1}}\\circ A)\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathfrak g\\;\\forall u\\in P\\;(A_u(\\xi_P(u))=\\xi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole\\text{-}principal\\text{-}connection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Omega^1(P;\\mathfrak g)\\land\n\\forall a\\in G\\;(R_a^*A=\\operatorname{Ad}_{a^{-1}}\\circ A)\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathfrak g\\;\\forall u\\in P\\;(A_u(\\xi_P(u))=\\xi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\to\nF_A\\coloneqq dA+\\frac12[A\\wedge A],\n\\qquad D_A\\phi\\coloneqq d\\phi+[A,\\phi]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\to\nF_A\\coloneqq dA+\\frac12[A\\wedge A],\n\\qquad D_A\\phi\\coloneqq d\\phi+[A,\\phi]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BogomolnyMonopole}_S(A,\\phi,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G,g,o,\\mathrm{vol}_g^o,*_g^o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land o\\in\\Omega^3(M)\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;(o_x\\neq0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g^o,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g^o,1,3)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\land\n\\phi\\in\\Omega^0(M;\\operatorname{ad}P)\\land F_A=*_{g}^{o}D_A\\phi\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BogomolnyMonopole}_S(A,\\phi,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G,g,o,\\mathrm{vol}_g^o,*_g^o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land o\\in\\Omega^3(M)\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;(o_x\\neq0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g^o,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g^o,1,3)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\land\n\\phi\\in\\Omega^0(M;\\operatorname{ad}P)\\land F_A=*_{g}^{o}D_A\\phi\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The principal-bundle structure, connection equivariance, curvature, orientation, and Hodge star are explicit; the Bogomolny equation is not asserted for untyped forms.</li>\n<li>The public predicate carries every topology, group operation, identity, volume form, and Hodge-star graph used by its assertion, and its principal-bundle call now matches the exact ten-place upstream signature.</li>\n<li>Finite energy and magnetic charge require separate asymptotic or boundary conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jaffe and Taubes, Vortices and Monopoles</li>\n<li>Donaldson and Kronheimer, The Geometry of Four-Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-gauge-theory","status":"resolved","id":"46de5f0e3011160d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-gauge-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-principal-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"5d5f05282b5c6816","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-principal-bundle]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hodge-star","status":"resolved","id":"c8c26f9dc2425e2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hodge-star]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M,g,o)","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"3","display":false},{"tex":"(p:P\\to M,\\tau_P,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak g","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Omega^1(P;\\mathfrak g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\Omega^0(M;\\operatorname{ad}P)","display":false},{"tex":"R_a:P\\to P","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi\\in\\mathfrak g","display":false},{"tex":"*_g^o","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{vol}_g^o","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BogomolnyMonopole}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole\\text{-}principal\\text{-}connection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Omega^1(P;\\mathfrak g)\\land\n\\forall a\\in G\\;(R_a^*A=\\operatorname{Ad}_{a^{-1}}\\circ A)\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathfrak g\\;\\forall u\\in P\\;(A_u(\\xi_P(u))=\\xi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\to\nF_A\\coloneqq dA+\\frac12[A\\wedge A],\n\\qquad D_A\\phi\\coloneqq d\\phi+[A,\\phi]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monopole}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BogomolnyMonopole}_S(A,\\phi,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G,g,o,\\mathrm{vol}_g^o,*_g^o)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land o\\in\\Omega^3(M)\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;(o_x\\neq0)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g^o,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g^o,1,3)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot_G,e_G)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalConnectionForm}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\land\n\\phi\\in\\Omega^0(M;\\operatorname{ad}P)\\land F_A=*_{g}^{o}D_A\\phi\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true}],"bytes":2857,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-858","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-monopole.md|58-df-monopole]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["46de5f0e3011160d","5d5f05282b5c6816","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","c8c26f9dc2425e2f"]}